  "notes": "{構|かま}える is a transitive verb.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧)\n- Pair: {構|かま}う (intransitive, though {構|かま}う has different meanings)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{店|みせ}→店：00497_mise⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{構|かま}える (set up a shop)\n- ⟦{家|いえ}→家：00612_ie⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{構|かま}える (establish a home)\n- ⟦{刀|かたな}→刀：02194_katana⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{構|かま}える (ready one's sword)\n- ⟦{斜|はす}→斜：00093_hasu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{構|かま}える (take a cynical stance)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {構|かま}えて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ can indicate either an ongoing state of readiness or an established setup.",
